  "term": "calcium regulation",
  "definition": "Calcium regulation here means control of calcium-related activity inside neurons as part of how α7 nicotinic acetylcholine receptor function changes their firing. In the thalamic reticular nucleus model, this calcium-linked control helped shape sleep- and wake-like network states and was relevant to seizure-related thalamocortical oscillations.",
